<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Maseca.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Maseca.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co analyst Enrique Figueroa confirmed that he raised his rating on Grupo Industrial Maseca SA de CV to buy from outperform, based primarily on weakness in the share price.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Maseca is one of the most attractively valued companies in our sector with better long-term growth prospects than any of our beverage stocks,&quot; Figueroa said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/8 at 18-3/8 on the NYSE.</p>
</text>
